---
layout: layouts/page.njk
basePath: /downloads/
title: Downloads
heading: Documents and downloads
standfirst: "Approved summit documents will be published here in their current versions."
description: Download current Kenya-China Tea Summit fact sheets, programme information, exhibitor guides, partnership documents and media resources.
sitemapPriority: 0.8
ctaBody: Register your interest to receive new documents and major summit announcements.
---

{# Category order is the order of this map, not alphabetical — an enquirer
   wants the overview before the policies. Categories with nothing published
   render nothing at all rather than an empty heading. #}
{% set groups = {
  brochure: "Summit overview",
  agenda: "Programme",
  exhibition: "Exhibition",
  sponsorship: "Partnership",
  report: "Reports",
  press: "Press",
  policy: "Policies"
} %}

{% set any = false %}
{% for key, label in groups %}
  {% set items = collections.downloads | byCategory(key) %}
  {% if items | length %}
    {% set any = true %}
<h2>{{ label }}</h2>
<ul class="dl-list">
  {% for d in items %}
  <li class="dl-item">
    <a class="dl-item__name" href="{{ d.data.file }}" download>{{ d.data.title }}</a>
    <span class="dl-item__meta">{{ d.data.format }} &middot; {{ (d.data.bytes / 1024) | round }} KB{% if d.data.pages %} &middot; {{ d.data.pages }} pp{% endif %} &middot; updated <time datetime="{{ d.data.updated | isoDate }}">{{ d.data.updated | readableDate }}</time></span>
    {% if d.data.description %}<span class="dl-item__desc">{{ d.data.description }}</span>{% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
  {% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if not any %}
<div class="note">
  <p class="note__label">Nothing published yet</p>
  <p>Documents appear here as the summit team releases them.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<h2>Coming soon</h2>

<ul>
  <li>Detailed programme</li>
  <li>Delegate information pack</li>
  <li>Exhibitor prospectus</li>
  <li>Partnership prospectus</li>
  <li>Travel and accommodation guide</li>
  <li>Media fact sheet and press kit</li>
  <li>Code of conduct</li>
</ul>

<div class="note">
  <p class="note__label">Version control</p>
  <p>Each document shown here displays its publication or revision date.</p>
</div>
